Counter-only texture register stability profile (RSX_PERF_TEXREG=1, default off).

Compares the 16 units' 9 raw texture words of each draw with the previous draw' inside the RSX_PERF_PROF window
and prints [perf-texreg] when the window closes: draws with all units unchanged, with every enabled and used unit
unchanged, per-unit change rates, and enabled units split into same / offset-only / other. No decision reads it.

